{"Title":"An Act amending the town charter in the town of Grafton relative to transitional provisions of the charter","BillNumber":"H4685","DocketNumber":"HD5129","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DKM1","Name":"David K. Muradian, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DKM1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-17T08:40:55.49"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DKM1","Name":"David K. Muradian, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DKM1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-17T08:40:55.49"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2024-05-17T08:42:03.24"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2024-05-17T08:40:55.49"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4685/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Muradian of Grafton and Senator Moore, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4685) of David K. Muradian, Jr., and Michael O. Moore (by vote of the town) relative to amending the charter in the town of Grafton relative to transitional provisions of the charter.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The charter of the town of Grafton, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth, as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by striking out Article 8.\r\n\tSECTION 2 . This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}